---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/privacy.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Sift Privacy Policy" description="Sift privacy policy. No data collected.">
  <main class="privacy-page grid-page">
    <a href="/sift/" class="back-link">&larr; Sift</a>

    <header class="privacy-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: March 16, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What Sift Does</h2>
      <p>Sift is a Chrome extension that cleans up your LinkedIn feed and helps you filter job listings. It runs entirely in your browser on LinkedIn pages.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p>Sift does <strong>not</strong> collect or store any personal data. Specifically:</p>
      <ul class="privacy-list">
        <li>No data sent to external servers by the extension itself</li>
        <li>No cookies set by the extension</li>
        <li>No user accounts or sign-in</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This website (not the extension) uses Google Analytics via Google Tag Manager to understand page visits and button clicks. Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="privacy-link">privacy policy</a> applies to that data. However, <strong>NO PERSONAL IDENTIFIERS</strong> are collected. The analytics data is fully anonymous and is only used to improve the experience.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Local Storage</h2>
      <p>Sift saves your preferences (skipped companies, skipped title keywords, muted keywords, toggle states) using Chrome's local storage API. This data stays on your device and is never transmitted anywhere.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Permissions</h2>
      <ul class="privacy-list">
        <li><strong>storage</strong>: to save your filter preferences locally</li>
        <li><strong>contextMenus</strong>: to add a right-click option for muting keywords</li>
        <li><strong>Host permission (linkedin.com)</strong>: to read and annotate job listings and feed posts on LinkedIn</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Sift loads the LXGW WenKai font from cdnjs.cloudflare.com. Cloudflare's privacy policy applies to that request. No other third-party services are used.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach out at <a href="/sift" class="privacy-link">kunli.co/sift</a>.</p>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
